{"STOP_FREEZE","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|st=friendly,neutral",{"Alright, I'm stopped - now what?","Why should I freeze? Make me","Whoa, easy, I'm not going anywhere, put the thing down, huh?","Ha, you're jumpy, that's cute, okay, I'm standing, now what?","I froze, see? You got me, what do you want?","Stopped, hands in plain sight, don't get excited"}},
