{"STOP_FREEZE","reg=raider|st=neutral,careful",{"Freeze? Hah! Look who thinks he's a cop now","You don't tell me when to stop, friend, I decide that","Oh, I'm stopping alright... I'm stopping to see how stupid you really are","Funny thing about \"freeze\"... it works better when the other guy's scared","Say that again, slower, I wanna make sure I heard you right"}},
{"STOP_FREEZE","reg=raider|st=hostile",{"FREEZE?! You freeze, you stupid son of a bitch, I'm the one holding the cards here!","Don't you dare give me orders, not you, NOT YOU!","Oh, you really want me to stop? Fine, I'll stop... right after I'm finished with you","Hahaha! Freeze, this one says! Boys, we got ourselves a deputy!"}},
{"STOP_FREEZE","reg=gang|st=neutral,careful",{"Freeze? Nah, I don't freeze for nobody","You must've mistaken me for somebody who gives a damn","Yeah? And what happens if I don't? Tell me, I'm curious"}},
{"STOP_FREEZE","reg=gang|st=hostile",{"Who the hell you talking to?! WHO?!","Tell me to freeze again, punk, go ahead, say it one more time!"}},
{"STOP_FREEZE","reg=club|st=neutral,careful",{"I haven't stopped for anybody since 1971, and you're not changing that today","Heh... the boys are gonna love this one","{g:Son|Young lady}, you don't give orders to a man who's got thirty years on you and a bad attitude"}},
