{"STOP_FREEZE","reg=crime|st=neutral,careful",{"I'd suggest you reconsider the tone of that request","Stopping is something I do on my own terms","How quaint, he thinks he has leverage"}},
{"STOP_FREEZE","reg=crime|st=hostile",{"You have made a tactical error, and you're about to find out what it costs"}},
{"STOP_FREEZE","reg=prison|st=neutral,careful",{"I-- no, I'm not stopping, I can't stop, if I stop they'll catch me","Don't yell at me, don't YELL at me, I've had enough yelling for ten lifetimes","You're not a guard, you can't tell me what to do... can you? Oh God, you can't, right?"}},
{"STOP_FREEZE","reg=prison|st=hostile",{"NO! I won't! You can't make me ever again!","SHUT UP shut up!! I'm not stopping, not for you!","Last guy yelled freeze at me was a CO in a tower - tower's empty now - think about that"}},
{"STOP_FREEZE","reg=outlaw|st=neutral,careful",{"Freeze? That's the second dumbest thing I've heard today","Quiet down, you're making a scene","I stop when I feel like it, and I don't feel like it"}},
{"STOP_FREEZE","reg=law|st=neutral,careful",{"Listen, I am the one who gives that order around here, let's not get confused","You're telling a deputy to freeze? Think about that for one second","Easy now, easy... you really don't want to do this"}},
