{"STOP_FREEZE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral,careful",{"AH- okay- okay- I'm stopped- I'm STOPPED- don't-","Oh my GOD, what?! What?! I froze, I'm frozen!","H-hold on, hold on, I'm not moving, see? not moving!!","SHIT- I froze, I'm frozen, please!","Nooo, I stopped, I stopped, please, please..","Okay- okay, I'm stopped, I'm not moving, look, I'm not moving!!","Oh God, oh God, I froze, I'm frozen, please don't, I'm not armed","H-hey, what- why, what did I do? I'm not doing anything!","Wait wait wait wait wait, I'm standing still, SEE? I'm standing still...","Shit, shit, okay, stopped, totally stopped, you can lower that now","Don't yell at me!! I'm stopped, I stopped, please just talk to me","I'm- I'm not even breathing, okay, what do you want, what do you WANT?","Alright, alright, you scared the hell out of me, what's going on?"}},
{"STOP_FREEZE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral,careful",{"Jesus, you scared the hell out of me, I'm stopped, I'm stopped","Stopped, I'm stopped, calm down","Whoa, whoa, WHOA, easy, I'm not moving a muscle","I'm stopped, relax, what's the problem?","Stopped, stopped, see? Now what's the hurry?","Jesus, you don't have to shout, I heard you the first time","I'm not twitching, tell me what you're so jumpy about","Easy, easy, I'm standing here like a statue, you happy?","You almost made me wet myself, damn, what is it?"}},
{"STOP_FREEZE","reg=law,swat|st=friendly,neutral,careful",{"Stopped, stopped, easy, what's the problem?","I'm not moving, you want to tell me what this is about?","Easy, I'm stopped, I'm one of the good guys here, let's lower our voices","Not moving, my hands are open, talk to me"}},
{"STOP_FREEZE","reg=military,elite|st=friendly,neutral,careful",{"Halted, stand by","Stopped, say what you need","Halted, identify yourself","Holding position, proceed with what you've got"}},
{"STOP_FREEZE","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|st=friendly,neutral,careful",{"Whoa, easy, easy, I'm froze, I'm froze, relax"}},
{"STOP_FREEZE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|st=careful,hostile",{"Say what you need to say, I'm not going anywhere, but I'm not liking this","You've got my attention, and you'd better have a good reason for it","Freeze?! Who the hell do you think you are, giving me orders?"}},
{"STOP_FREEZE","reg=family|st=friendly,neutral,careful",{"Oh my stars, you startled me half to death, what is it, honey?","I'm standing still, I'm standing still, I'm an old person, I can't do anything else","I'm not moving, whatever you need, just don't point that at the kids"}},
